# ==============================================================================
# EatInformed Mobile - Environment Configuration (.env)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to `mobile/.env`
#    cp mobile/.env.example mobile/.env
#
# 2. Configure your Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID:
#    - Go to Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
#      or Firebase Console (Authentication > Sign-in method > Google)
#    - Select your EatInformed project
#    - Go to: APIs & Services > Credentials
#    - Look for or create an "OAuth 2.0 Client ID" of type "Web application"
#      (Note: Expo's WebBrowser / AuthSession flow uses the Web client ID)
#    - Add Authorized redirect URIs (Must all start with https:// and have a domain):
#      - https://auth.expo.io/@amitdevx/eatinformed (for Expo Go)
#      - https://nutriscan-1zg7u.firebaseapp.com/__/auth/handler (Firebase default)
#      - https://eatinformed.amitdevx.tech/__/auth/handler (Firebase custom domain)
#      - https://eatinformed.amitdevx.tech/auth/callback (Production web callback)
#      (Note: Do NOT add custom schemes like 'eatinformed:/...' here; Google Cloud
#       strictly rejects non-https URLs for Web application client IDs).
#    - Copy the Client ID (looks like: 1234567890-abcdef.apps.googleusercontent.com)
#    - Paste it below as EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
#
# 3. For Android Standalone builds (EAS build / APK):
#    - Create an "Android" OAuth client ID in Google Cloud Console with:
#      Package Name: com.eatinformed.app
#      SHA-1 Certificate Fingerprint: Run `keytool -keystore mobile/android/app/debug.keystore -list -v`
#      (Android client IDs do not require redirect URIs; Google verifies via package & SHA-1).
#
# 4. Expo SDK automatically exposes any variable prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_
#    to your mobile JavaScript bundle at build time.
# ==============================================================================

# Backend API URL (defaults to http://10.0.2.2:9003 for Android Emulator, or live domain in release)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://eatinformed.amitdevx.tech

# Google OAuth Client ID (Web Application Client ID from Google Cloud Console)
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
